OL,3,GNEWSATorrent of flood water from old
OL,4,Amine ruined our homes - we fear it will
OL,5,Ahappen again
OL,6,
OL,7,FFamilies whose homes were submerged by
OL,8,Fa torrent of mine water after a quarry
OL,9,Fblast fear their children could be
OL,10,Fcaught in another flood as experts warn
OL,11,Fother UK communities may be at risk.
OL,13,FFifteen homes in the of village of
OL,14,FGwaelod-y-Garth, north of Cardiff were
OL,15,Faffected - and 13 evacuated - when a
OL,16,F"tsunami river" from old iron mine
OL,17,Fworkings hit after a planned quarry
OL,18,Fexplosion in south Wales.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
