OL,3,GNEWSATorrent of flood water from old
OL,4,Amine ruined our homes - we fear it will
OL,5,Ahappen again
OL,6,
OL,7,FNow experts have told a BBC
OL,8,Finvestigation more needs to be done to
OL,9,Fprotect people and prevent them living
OL,10,Fin unsellable homes.
OL,12,FThe UK and Welsh governments said there
OL,13,Fwas no "national assessment" of risks
OL,14,Fposed by flooded mines but both added
OL,15,Fthey're working to reduce the "risk" of
OL,16,Fflooding.
